It certainly adds to the challenge to require rogues to polymorph to finish
their quest.  However, there is the possibility of an "instant" death...

If you fall through a trapdoor into the lowest rogue level (perhaps one
created with a wand of digging), you may wind up in one of the rooms with
no doors.  If you don't have the means to polymorph (and cannot level teleport,
and have no cursed potions of gain level), then you will eventually starve.

